Package: com.551.islandbatterynotch
Name: Dynamic Island Battery Notch
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Shows your battery level as a coloured line around the Dynamic Island. The line gets shorter as your battery runs down. Choose your colours, a pulsing charging outline, and separate line thicknesses for normal use and charging. The outline automatically follows Dynamic Island size changes including screen recording, calls and charging, without timed hiding. Fallback Lock Screen dimensions remain if needed. For iPhone 14 Pro Max on iOS 16 (rootless).
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
